op\ud83e\uddf9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092040/extras/8c37b3e9f6f83c940451e54d00a0fa75.poster.avif?t=1760373564\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092040/extras/8c37b3e9f6f83c940451e54d00a0fa75.webm?t=1760373564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092040/extras/8c37b3e9f6f83c940451e54d00a0fa75.mp4?t=1760373564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clean the dirt your customers or wet clothes make and repair the machines that need fixing. You can decorate your laundromat and buy items how you like. You can upgrade your shop to become the biggest laundromat. Maximize your income and make famous people your regular customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf40Find Forgotten Item of Customers\ud83c\udf40</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092040/extras/529c23bd4cde16d9a936e0ca828d11c7.poster.avif?t=1760373564\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092040/extras/529c23bd4cde16d9a936e0ca828d11c7.webm?t=1760373564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092040/extras/529c23bd4cde16d9a936e0ca828d11c7.mp4?t=1760373564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers often forget some of their items in their basket. You can take them or leave them. One man's trash is another man's treasure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">